@startuml
!theme plain

package "Event-Driven Architecture (EDA) Components" {
  component [Event Producer\n(Laravel OutboxService)] as Producer
  
  database "Event Store / Transactional Outbox\n(outbox_events Table)" as OutboxStore {
    [Pending Events]
    [Published Events]
    [Failed / Dead-letter]
  }
  
  component [Event Dispatcher Daemon\n(Artisan outbox:dispatch)] as Dispatcher
  
  interface "Idempotency Manager\n(Correlation ID / Workflow Ref)" as Idempotency
  
  package "Event Consumers / Handlers" {
    [ActivityPlan EventHandler] as PlanHandler
    [PatientReport EventHandler] as ReportHandler
    [ProgressRecorded EventHandler] as ProgressHandler
  }
  
  component [Temporal Client Service] as TempClient
  component [Audit & Event Logger] as Logger
}

[Laravel Controllers / Services] --> Producer : 1. Record Domain Event in DB Transaction
Producer --> OutboxStore : 2. Atomic INSERT with Business Entities

Dispatcher --> OutboxStore : 3. Poll Pending Events (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
Dispatcher --> Idempotency : 4. Check Duplicate & Correlation ID
Dispatcher --> PlanHandler : 5. Dispatch Event
Dispatcher --> ReportHandler
Dispatcher --> ProgressHandler

PlanHandler --> TempClient : 6. StartWorkflow / SignalUpdate / Cancel
ReportHandler --> TempClient : 7. SignalPatientReport
ProgressHandler --> Logger : 8. Record Progress Audit Log

TempClient --> OutboxStore : 9. Mark Event as 'published' (or increment retry on fail)
@enduml
